\label{thm pmt}{\cite{Witten1981, DingSpacetimePMT}} 
Let $(M^n,g,k)$ be an asymptotically flat spin initial data set.
Assume that the dominant energy condition
\begin{align*}
    \mu \ge |J|
\end{align*}
holds, where $\mu$ denotes the energy density and $J$ the momentum density.
Then the ADM energy $E$ and linear momentum $P$ satisfy
\begin{align*}
    E \ge |P|.
\end{align*}

